    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6be96dc4-bf99-44d9-b681-571c96ca811b-image.png\" style=\"width: 206px; height: 108px;\" /></p><p>Structure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(Open book type) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Non-planar</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is used in the treatment of effluents.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4a7f97fb-b8ac-4eef-a5ba-0f74a745252f-image.png\" style=\"width: 157px; height: 98px;\" />&nbsp;act as both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is miscible in water due to hydrogen bonding.</p>",
